# CFIRE-UPSTREAM: CF-031
# See ../linux/flint-native-gui.pc. Windows port (windows-port branch only): the
# clipboard and window calls are user32. Session lock notifications come from wtsapi32.dll,
# looked up at run time (flint_sysevents.hpp): FreeRDP's static winpr defines the same
# names. ext:webui already links what WebView2 needs.
Name: flint-native-gui
Description: Native shims of Flint's desktop app (Windows)
Version: 1
Cflags: -I${pcfiledir}/../../uievents/native
Libs: -luser32
